    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d74-a1">

                <pb facs="0230" n="102" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg102"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Zaldivar to
                        Mr. Whitehouse</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santa Ana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-04-14"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 14,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In answer to, your telegram of this date, I inform you with much pleasure that we
                    are at present engaged in fixing the basis of peace between this Republic and
                    that of Guatemala.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>R. ZALDIVAR.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
